sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Learner
  participant N as Nav (MainActivity)
  participant VM as InteractiveLessonVM (base.c)
  participant P as Parser (te.c.b)
  participant R as Room
  U->>N: tap lesson
  N->>P: parse bundled lesson XML
  P-->>VM: modules[] (LessonModule.*)
  VM->>R: createLessonProgress(tries=0, attempts=0, in_queue=1)
  VM->>VM: pick CORRECT/WRONG paragraphs, select isDefault interaction
  VM-->>U: render code blocks + slots
